     <H2 style="MARGIN: 13pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-no-proof: yes">关于组织开展党组织和党员履行公开承诺专项评议的通知</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></H2>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT size=3>学校各支部：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">根据绍市教党</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>[2010]25</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">号文件精神，学校各级党组织和党员要认真开展<SPAN style="mso-no-proof: yes">履行公开承诺专项评议活动，现将市教育局《关于组织开展市属学校党组织和党员履行公开承诺专项评议的通知》转发给各支部，请各支部按照通知要求认真组织本支部党员做好评议工作。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 13pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-no-proof: yes; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">绍兴市教育局关于组织开展市属学校党组织和党员<SPAN lang=EN-US><BR></SPAN>履行公开承诺专项评议的通知</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></H2>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各市属学校党组织：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自创先争优活动开展以来，各校党组织和广大党员结合实际，以服务发展、服务社会、服务群众、服务党员为主要内容，向党员群众作出了公开承诺。为</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">激发基层党组织“五好”创建和党员</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">争当先锋</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">的热情和动力，营造“定目标、作承诺、创先进、争优秀”的浓厚氛围，根据市委创先争优活动领导小组办公室绍市组创办发〔</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">2010</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">〕</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">号文件精神和工作安排，决定组织开展一次市属学校党组织和党员履行公开承诺情况专项评议，现将有关事项通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=3>一、评议对象及时间安排<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">专项评议的对象为创先争优活动中作出公开承诺的学校党组织和党员。评议时间从</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">2010</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">月中旬开始，到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">2011</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">月上旬前结束。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=3>二、评议形式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">学校党组织和党员自评。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">对照公开承诺事项，自查完成情况和存在问题，撰写个人自查分析报告，并提出整改举措。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">2</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">领导点评。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">创先争优活动联系领导将听取一次联系点党组织履行公开承诺的情况汇报，并进行现场点评。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">3</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">党员群众评议。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">学校党组织</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">可采取问卷调查、设置意见箱、召开评议会、发放评议表等形式，自觉接受党员群众特别是服务对象的民主评议。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">组织考评。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">学校党组织要对党员履行公开承诺情况进行考核评价，并评选出本地本单位的“创先争优党员之星”，深入挖掘基层党组织和党员闪光言行。在此基础上，市教育局创先办对市属学校党组织进行考核评价。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=3>三、基本要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">市属学校党组织</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">要充分认识开展公开承诺考评的重要意义，加强领导，精心组织，结合年底党员民主评议</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">认真组织开展专项评议活动</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">确保评议工作覆盖到每个学校基层党组织、每名党员。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">坚持工作原则。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">坚持实事求是，将公开承诺已经履行、尚未履行或者履行存在一定困难的实际情况，如实向党组织和党员群众作出说明；<SPAN style="COLOR: black">坚持群众路线，广泛听取群众意见，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">评议结果在一定范围内进行公示，</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自觉接受群众监督；坚持分类实施，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">对不同岗位的党员分别提出要求，努力使评议工作贴近基层实际。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">加强督查评议。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">要实施承诺兑现的登记、督查、交流、通报制度，实行动态管理，建立承诺台账，兑现一件、销号一件，对没有按时完成的要及时提醒和督促，对满意率低于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">60%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">的党组织和个人将责令限期整改。同时，要建立健全学校党组织和党员公开承诺、践诺评议的长效机制。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">加强宣传引导。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各校党组织要充分利用宣传阵地，大力宣传</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">一诺千金、有诺必践，以实际行动取信于民以及</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">考评承诺的好做法、好经验，确保让群众得到更多实惠。各校党组织要把</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">兑现承诺目标情况</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">作为年度评议党员的重要内容和党组织、党员评先评优的重要依据，对履诺表现较差、群众意见较大的要提出批评教育，对拒不改正的要作出组织处理，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">以弘扬先进，带动后进。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">各校组织开展专项评议后，要形成总结报告，对总体情况、主要做法和践诺特色亮点进行总结回顾，于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">11</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">日前及时报市教育局创先办。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
